---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import training from "../assets/images/training.png";
---

<section id="about" class="bg-brand-black w-full max-w-full overflow-hidden pt-[var(--section-space)] pb-[var(--section-space)]">
  <div class="site-container w-full">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 md:gap-16 items-center w-full min-w-0">
      <div class="reveal">
        <p class="text-[0.65rem] font-medium tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-white/50 mb-3">01 / About</p>
        <h2 class="poster-heading text-[clamp(2.75rem,9vw,5.75rem)] mb-6">
          The Playground
        </h2>
        <p class="text-white/65 leading-relaxed mb-4 text-sm md:text-base">
          The Playground is a training community built around bringing people together, getting active and having a good time.
        </p>
        <p class="text-white/65 leading-relaxed mb-4 text-sm md:text-base">
          From group workouts and outdoor sessions to challenges, events and everything in between, it’s a place to train hard, meet good people and try something new.
        </p>
        <p class="text-white/65 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
          No egos. No pressure. Just good energy, good people and a reason to show up.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <div class="relative aspect-[3/4] md:aspect-[4/5] w-full max-w-[450px] md:ml-auto bg-brand-black overflow-hidden">
          <Image
            src={training}
            alt="Athletes recovering between efforts at The Playground"
            widths={[400, 600, 900]}
            sizes="(min-width: 768px) 450px, calc(100vw - 3rem)"
            loading="lazy"
            class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
